    "name": "Saraha App - Auth Security",
    "description": "Import this collection into Postman and set baseUrl to the test API. Run the server with NODE_ENV=test so OTPs are returned in API responses instead of sent. Covers five-failure login lockout, OTP setup, login confirmation, OTP attempt limits, and one-time code use.",
